                    insight_gamed:          `Gamed again: the redesign repeated the original failure — feedback added without lowering the cost of candour, a score still feeding pay, or the Atlas fix mandated by fiat. The squad will optimise the new measure exactly as they gamed the old one. Trust never moved.`,
                    insight_short:          `Partial turnaround. Some levers moved the right way, but the loop isn't whole: trust, adaptive performance and delivery risk aren't all where they need to be inside the 10-week window.`,
